      "parameters": {
        "path": "wondertales-story",
        "formTitle": "Create a WonderTales video",
        "formDescription": "Use n8n execution results to see status and errors. All uploads remain Private. Give the story an engaging opening, a clear problem and a satisfying ending. Use original or licensed characters/stories. Music paths point to the worker imports folder. Narration defaults to spoken speech; your own audio can include singing. Scene plan: one block per scene with Characters:, Setting:, Action:, Narration: lines; separate blocks with ---. Use 4/8/12/15 scenes for 30/60/90/120 seconds. Scene narration replaces the main story for voice-over. Each scene gets up to 8 seconds (last scene may be shorter).",
